; RUN: llc -mtriple=riscv64 -mattr=+v,+zvfh,+zvfbfmin,+experimental-zvvfp16mm,+experimental-zvvbf16mm,+experimental-zvvofp8fp16mm,+experimental-zvvofp8bf16mm,+experimental-zvvbf16fp32mm,+experimental-zvvbf16fp64mm,+experimental-zvvxofp8bf16mm,+experimental-zvvxi8bf16mm,+experimental-zvvxi8fp16mm \
